    {
      "kind": "title",
      "source_text": "目指せ、Jupiterイチのモテ男！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あー……。なんつーか、その服、かわいいっすね。\nだから、俺と……。くっ……！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あー！　ダメだ、上手くカッコつかねぇ！\nやっぱり俺じゃ、北斗には勝てないのか……！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（今度出るTV番組『万物にモテろ！』で、\n視聴者を口説かなきゃならねーのに……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（全然イイ台詞が思いつかねーし、\n手ごたえもねえ！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……番組の事前アンケートだと、Jupiter内なら\n北斗が一位！　って言われてるらしいんだよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "けど、練習すれば俺だって北斗を超えられるはずだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……それに、この番組は、\n男極リーグの『モテ部門』と連動してる）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（俺たちJupiterの活躍次第で、\n315プロが男極KINGに近づけるんだ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "弱気になってる場合じゃねえよな！　だが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "口説き文句なんて、どうやったら思いつくんだ？\n目の前に相手でもいれば違うんだろうが……ん？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_02_a:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_02_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_02_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 19,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……そうだ、こいつだ！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
